.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt CP 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm cp
.Nd copy files and directories
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl r
.Ar source target
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility copies
.Ar source
to
.Ar target
in 4 KiB chunks.
If
.Ar target
is an existing directory, the copy is created below it using the source's final path component.
.Pp
With
.Fl r ,
directories are copied recursively; without it a directory source is an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mv 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
